          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nīmo gwa būtūng'wa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū mu yenīyī, būlī munhū ni atūbalage a bise gīkī tūlī batūmami ba ng'wa Kilisito, na babilisīlwa ba mbisīla ja mihayo ya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo gūgongilwe ho a henaho gūlī gīkī, būlī milisīlwa abize nsanyiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we nūūlū mukanisola būbi ū nene, nūūlū banhū bangī bose bose būnilamula, ū gwenūyo gūlī mhayo ndo no; ū nene ng'wenekīlī natīko kwisola būbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno natabūmanile ū būbi ūbo nalī nabo; alīyo nahene h'ītī gīkī nakūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja kūlwa mhayo gwenūyo, nguno ū namuji wane ng'wene Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya mutalamulage mihayo yose yose aho lītaalī ū kūng'wa ī likanza, kūshisha ize ū Seeba ūyo akwītendegesa ha ng'wape pyī īyo yibisile mu giiti, na a maganiko ga myoyo agooleche hape; hūna ū būkumīlījiwa wa būlī munhū būkūfuma kūlī Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū badūgū bane, ū mu mihayo yenīyo nitūūlaga ho nene na Apolo kūbiza shigemelo kūlwa kūmulanga, gīkī ū mu kiganikīle king'we ng'ooye ū kwīkīlanhya īyo yandīkilwe, pyī nū kwikumīlīja kūlwa munhū ūyū, lelo ū ūngī ng'wene ng'wandalaha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū bebe wikīlile mu ginehe nabo a bangī? Nūūlū kī īsho ūtanukūlile ū bebe? Na lūūlū īkī nang'ho ūlī ng'wanukūji dūhū, nibūlī ūkūdoosaga, gītī gīkī ū bebe ūtī ng'wanukūji! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha a bing'we ng'wapandīkile ī sha kūng'wigela, ng'wasabile, ng'wabizile batemi nūūlū aho tūtī hamò ning'we; na ng'hana temagi na a bise tūteme hamò ning'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno naliganika gīkī ū Mulungu atūtūūlile ho a bise batūng'wa, gīkī tūbize ba kūmalīja ū mu banhū abo basolilwe kūlwa kūbūlagwa. Tūlībiza gītī shiiloleelo ū mu sī, ū kū bamalaika nū kū banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūlī bachilū chilū kūlwa ng'wa Kilisito; lelo a bing'we mulī na masala ū mulī Kilisito, a bise tūlī bagokolo, a bing'we mulī na nguzu; a bing'we mukūkumīlījiagwa, alīyo a bise tūkūdalahagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūshisha ikanza īlī a bise tūkūkoyiagwa būtuubu na nota na būzuuka; tūkūjaga tūkundugwa būlī kwene, tūtī na nzengo gwa kwikala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūkūluha luhaga kūtūmama na makono gise benekīlī; ūlū twadūkwa tūkūlombelaga lubango, nū mu kūluhiwa nū ng'wene tūkwiyūmīlījaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū twasondagūlwa tūkūshoshaga mu būlyehu; kūshisha haha tūkūbonagwa gītī tūlī mapalala ga mu sī; gītī būsoso wa būsoso bose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natūng'wandīkīlaga ī yenīyī gīkī namudimye minala, alīyo nalīmuganikīla gītī baana bane batogwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī nūūlū ni ng'wabiza na balangi bingī na ginehe ū mulī Kilisito, alīyo nahene mutī na basīng'we bingī, nguno naamubyala nene ū mulī Kilisito Yesu, mu nzīla ya Ng'hūlū Jawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nalīng'wikūmbīlīja mubize balondeeji bane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Timotheo ū ng'witūnja wane ntogwa, na munhū nsanyiwa mulī Seeba, nalīntūma ize ūko mulī kūlwa nguno ya kūng'wizūkīja ī nzīla jane ū mulī Kilisito Yesu, nū mumo nakūjaga nūlangīla ū mu kanisa pyī ī jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike bamò bing'we bandije kwigīmba gīmba gītī gīkī natizaga ko ū nene! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Seeba ūlū ūtogwa nakwiza, nababone ūmo bakūhayīlaga a bigīmba gīmbi benabo; nū būdūla wabo nabūbone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu būtī mu mihayo dūhū, alīyo būlī mu būdūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ni gūlī ginehe ūyo mugūtogilwe? Namusange koi bo milang'ha, nūūlū nize mu būtogwa na moyo mpolo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
